              "jcr:created": "Mon Dec 11 2023 18:50:45 GMT+0000",
              "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Intentionally designed</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Integrated display featuring endoscopic and tri-planer CT views&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Optional full tower and display monitor</li>\n<li>Patient and universal tracker</li>\n<li>Clamps</li>\n<li>Pointers</li>\n<li>Suction</li>\n<li>XprESS dilation system and TGS guidewire**</li>\n<li>Small footprint for easy integration</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1em\"><span class=\"fontsize-8em\"><sub>&nbsp;</sub></span></span></span></p>\n",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Jan 19 2024 18:54:26 GMT+0000",
