          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/columncontrol/cols2_1-3_2-3",
          "col1": {
            "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
            "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
            "text_copy": {
              "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
              "jcr:createdBy": "user-4051b8581f@example.invalid",
              "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-b81b2f2bb0@example.invalid",
              "jcr:created": "Mon Dec 11 2023 18:50:45 GMT+0000",
              "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Customizable</span></span></p>\n<p>The Stryker ENT navigation system adapts to your preferences, tools, and workflows for a more seamless surgical experience. The system can track nearly any rigid instrument to navigate with confidence and a variety of malleable instruments<sup>3</sup> with built-in tracking technology.&nbsp;<br>\n</p>\n",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Feb 02 2024 14:22:00 GMT+0000",
              "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
              "textIsRich": "true"
            }
          },
          "col2": {
            "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
