      "tabs_parsys3": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "tabPosId": 3,
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "cols2": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-4051b8581f@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-4051b8581f@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Mon Dec 11 2023 18:57:22 GMT+0000",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Dec 11 2023 18:57:22 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/columncontrol/cols2",
          "col1": {
            "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
            "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
            "text": {
              "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
              "jcr:createdBy": "user-4051b8581f@example.invalid",
              "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-2fc21bab61@example.invalid",
              "jcr:created": "Mon Dec 11 2023 18:57:59 GMT+0000",
              "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Precise</span></span></p>\n<p>Our ENT surgical navigation system is designed to enhance precision.<sup>1</sup> Powered by Scopis software, the system offers standard-of-care electromagnetic (EM) technology combined with groundbreaking target-guided surgery and augmented reality (AR). This serves to improve visualization of critical anatomy and tissue while merging planning to enhance visual information during surgery.<sup>2</sup></p>\n<p>This allows you to do the following:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Analyze 3D anatomy</li>\n<li>Plan sinus drainage pathways and target anatomy</li>\n<li>View surgical plans overlaid into the endoscopic image with AR&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p>ENT navigation system’s malleable instrumentation also allows for consistent precision while tracking from the tip of your pre-calibrated instrument.*&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Aug 04 2025 17:03:04 GMT+0000",
              "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
              "textIsRich": "true"
            }
          },
          "col2": {
            "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
            "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
